# Platform — portal member profile & `/me` area (architecture freeze)

**Status:** 2026-07-02 · **Contract frozen** · **M6 aligned** — `GET/PATCH /api/me/profile`, SDK capabilities, Denali skin + DEN-PROF E2E (roadmap fields deferred)

**Related:**

- [platform-portal-member.mdoc](./platform-portal-member.mdoc) — session + `/me/registrations`
- [platform-portal-registration-intake.mdoc](./platform-portal-registration-intake.mdoc) — intake capability pattern (template)
- [portal-registration-ui.md](../workspaces/denali/portal-registration-ui.md) — current minimal `/me/profile` hooks
- [IDENTITY-PORT-SCOPE.md](../phase-9/appendices/IDENTITY-PORT-SCOPE.md) — `/identity/me` (requires amendment)

This document is the **single source of truth** for aligning:

`/me/profile` · `/me/registrations` · `identity/me` (BFF upstream only) · `public-auth` (OTP/onboarding) · workspace-sdk capabilities

---

## A) Frozen invariants (non-negotiable)

| ID | Invariant |
| -- | --------- |
| **INV-MP-01** | **Profile BFF family** — text fields via `GET/PATCH /api/me/profile`; avatar via `POST/DELETE/GET /api/me/avatar*`; mobile change via `POST /api/me/mobile/*`. Portal must not call upstream `identity/me` except through these BFF routes. |
| **INV-MP-02** | **No workspace imports in portal** — `apps/portal` must not static-import `packages/workspaces/*` or `@app-tour/workspace-{id}`. |
| **INV-MP-03** | **Identity owns persistence** — `GET/PATCH /identity/me` is the only API persistence surface; storage = `UserTenant.membershipMetadata` via `me.service` / repository. |
| **INV-MP-04** | **Single canonical contract** — `MemberProfileView` / `MemberProfilePatch` in `@app-tour/workspace-sdk`; portal BFF maps to/from `identity/me` internally. |
| **INV-MP-05** | **No plugin branching in portal** — portal uses `bootstrap.pluginId` only to call SDK resolvers; no `pluginId === "denali"` (or similar) in `apps/portal`. |
| **INV-MP-06** | **Capability-driven UI only** — profile field visibility and editability come from `resolveMemberProfileCapabilities(pluginId)`; forms render slots, not hardcoded field lists. |
| **INV-MP-07** | **No validation in UI layer** — portal components must not contain regex or business validation; SDK + API return coded errors; UI displays them. |
| **INV-MP-08** | **Workspace extends profile only via SDK** — workspace-specific rules live in `packages/workspaces/{id}` and are invoked from API layer, never from portal. |
| **INV-MP-09** | **Portal owns presentation** — layout, i18n, theming, accessibility; not business rules. |
| **INV-MP-10** | **Registrations stay on `/api/me/registrations`** — member bookings/receipt BFF is separate from profile BFF; both share session headers via `buildMemberApiHeaders`. |

**Session (aligned with code, supersedes stale doc text):**

| Item | Frozen value |
| ---- | ------------ |
| Member cookie | `atour_mb_session` (`SESSION_COOKIE_NAMES.member` in `@app-tour/session-client`) |
| Operator cookie | `atour_op_session` — not used by portal member flows |
| JWT validation | `validateSessionToken` in portal middleware + BFF |
| Tenant binding | `sessionTenantMatchesHost` on `/me/*` and `/api/me/*` |

