## B) Current state mapping (repo truth · post-M6)

### Layer diagram (as implemented today)

```text
apps/portal/app/me/profile/page.tsx
  SSR fetchMemberProfile() ──► GET /api/me/profile (same-origin BFF)
       │
       └──► MemberProfileForm (client, capability-driven)
              PATCH ──► /api/me/profile

apps/portal/app/catalog/.../public-catalog-registration-flow.tsx
  GET ──► /api/me/profile  (registration pre-fill when session exists)

apps/portal/app/api/me/profile/route.ts  (ONLY portal identity/me entry)
  GET/PATCH ──► apps/api/identity/me  (internal upstream)

apps/api/src/identity/me.routes.ts
  handleGetIdentityMe / handlePatchIdentityMe

apps/api/src/identity/me.service.ts
  getOperatorProfile / patchOperatorProfile
  └── membership-metadata.ts → UserTenant.membershipMetadata

packages/workspace-sdk
  resolveCatalogIntakeCapabilities(pluginId)  ✅
  resolveMemberProfileCapabilities(pluginId)  ✅ M1
```

### Historical note (pre-M4 — removed)

Legacy `session-profile` BFF and direct portal `identity/me` SSR were removed in M4. See migration plan M1–M4 below.

