## C) Target architecture

### Layering (frozen target)

```text
apps/portal (presentation)
  /me/profile UI slots ← resolveMemberProfileCapabilities(pluginId)
  GET/PATCH /api/me/profile  (ONLY profile BFF)
       │
       ▼
@app-tour/workspace-sdk (contracts + registry)
  MemberProfileView
  MemberProfilePatch
  resolveMemberProfileCapabilities(pluginId)
  buildMemberProfileUpstreamPatch(pluginId, patch)   // maps portal → identity/me body
  validateMemberProfilePatch(pluginId, patch)         // coded errors; no UI regex
       │
       ▼
apps/api/identity (persistence)
  GET/PATCH /identity/me
  me.service → membershipMetadata
  (optional future: workspace validation hook inside API — not portal)
       │
       ▼
packages/workspaces/{id} (business rules — API-invoked only)
  workspace-specific validation adapters when needed
```

### Canonical contract (SDK · frozen names)

**`MemberProfileView`** — portal BFF `GET /api/me/profile` response body:

```typescript
type MemberProfileFieldId =
  | "displayName"
  | "mobile"
  | "email"
  | "nationalId"
  | "fatherName"
  | "birthDate"
  | "gender"
  | "avatarUrl";

type MemberProfileView = {
  readonly ok: true;
  readonly contractVersion: "v1";
  readonly profile: {
    readonly userId: string;
    readonly tenantId: string;
    readonly role: string;
    readonly fields: Readonly<Partial<Record<MemberProfileFieldId, string | null>>>;
    readonly capabilities: MemberProfileCapabilities; // echo for client hydration
  };
};
```

**`MemberProfilePatch`** — portal BFF `PATCH /api/me/profile` request body:

```typescript
type MemberProfilePatch = {
  readonly contractVersion?: "v1";
  readonly fields: Partial<Record<MemberProfileFieldId, string | null>>;
};
```

**`MemberProfileApiError`** — unified BFF failure body (`ok: false`):

```typescript
type MemberProfileApiError = {
  readonly code: string;
  readonly message: string;
  readonly fieldErrors?: Partial<Record<MemberProfileFieldId, string>>;
};
```

**Rules:**

- **camelCase only** at portal BFF boundary (fixes current snake_case split).
- BFF translates to `PatchOperatorProfileRequest` (identity internal) on upstream `PATCH /identity/me`.
- Read-only fields in capabilities must be rejected with `PROFILE_FIELD_READ_ONLY` if present in patch.
- Unknown fields for plugin → `PROFILE_FIELD_NOT_SUPPORTED`.

### SDK capability registry (frozen API · M1 landed)

Module: `packages/workspace-sdk/src/profile/resolve-member-profile-capabilities.ts`

```typescript
type MemberProfileCapabilities = {
  readonly editableFields: readonly MemberProfileFieldId[];
  readonly readOnlyFields: readonly MemberProfileFieldId[];
  readonly sections?: readonly { readonly id: string; readonly fields: readonly MemberProfileFieldId[] }[];
  readonly validators: Readonly<Partial<Record<MemberProfileFieldId, MemberProfileFieldValidator>>>;
};

function resolveMemberProfileCapabilities(pluginId: string): MemberProfileCapabilities;
```

Validators live in `member-profile-validators.ts` — **BFF/API only**; portal UI must not call them (INV-MP-07).

**Initial registry (v1 · frozen):**

| pluginId | editableFields | readOnlyFields |
| -------- | -------------- | -------------- |
| `denali` | `displayName`, `email`, `nationalId`, `fatherName`, `birthDate` | `mobile` (+ avatar via `/api/me/avatar` · mobile change via `/api/me/mobile/*` when `mobileChangeViaOtp`) |
| `urban` | `displayName` | `email` |

Rows are **manifest-generated** (`workspace-member-profile-capabilities.generated.ts`). Unknown `pluginId` → `MemberProfileNotConfiguredError` (fail-closed; no silent default).

Workspace deltas documented in `docs/workspaces/{id}/portal-member-profile.md` (Denali first).

### Single profile BFF (frozen routes)

| Method | Path | Auth | Upstream |
| ------ | ---- | ---- | -------- |
| `GET` | `/api/me/profile` | `atour_mb_session` | `GET /identity/me` → map to `MemberProfileView` |
| `PATCH` | `/api/me/profile` | `atour_mb_session` | SDK patch build → `PATCH /identity/me` |
| `POST` | `/api/me/avatar` | `atour_mb_session` | `POST /identity/me/avatar` |
| `DELETE` | `/api/me/avatar` | `atour_mb_session` | `DELETE /identity/me/avatar` |
| `GET` | `/api/me/avatar/url` | `atour_mb_session` | `GET /identity/me/avatar/url` |
| `POST` | `/api/me/mobile/request-otp` | `atour_mb_session` | `POST /identity/me/mobile/request-otp` |
| `POST` | `/api/me/mobile/verify` | `atour_mb_session` | `POST /identity/me/mobile/verify` (+ session cookie refresh) |

**Not profile BFF:** all `public-auth/*` except onboarding (`register-complete`).

### Identity persistence (unchanged authority)

| Field | Storage key in `membershipMetadata` |
| ----- | ----------------------------------- |
| `displayName` | `displayName` |
| `email` | `email` |
| `nationalId` | `nationalId` |
| `fatherName` | `fatherName` |
| `birthDate` | `birthDate` |
| `gender` | `gender` |
| `avatar` | `avatar.storageKey` |

Source: `apps/api/src/identity/membership-metadata.ts` · `me.service.ts`.

