| ------------ | ------------------- | ---- |
| Portal SSR `fetch(…/identity/me)` | **RESOLVED M3** | INV-MP-01, INV-MP-07 |
| Profile PATCH under public-auth namespace | **RESOLVED M4** | INV-MP-01 |
| Regex validation in `member-profile-form.tsx` | **RESOLVED M3** | INV-MP-07 |
| Hardcoded 3-field form (no capabilities) | **RESOLVED M3** | INV-MP-06 |
| snake_case profile DTO at portal BFF | **RESOLVED M2/M5** | INV-MP-04 |
| Doc cookie name `session` | **OPEN** — member doc drift | stale vs `atour_mb_session` |
| Documented logout route missing | **RESOLVED** (2026-07-02) — `POST /api/public-auth/logout` |
| `fetchMemberRegistrations` returns `[]` on error | **OPEN** | observability debt |
| `if (pluginId === "denali")` in portal profile | **Not present** | INV-MP-05 — guarded |

