## CODEBASE REALITY AUDIT (post-M6 · 2026-07-01)

### `/me/profile/page.tsx` SSR behavior

- Calls `fetchMemberProfile(host)` → same-origin `GET /api/me/profile`.
- Does **not** call `identity/me` or legacy session-profile paths.
- On failure shows `loadFailed` message (no silent empty form).

### BFF vs direct API usage

| Consumer | Read path | Write path |
| -------- | --------- | ---------- |
| `me/profile/page.tsx` (SSR) | `GET /api/me/profile` via `fetchMemberProfile` | — |
| `member-profile-form.tsx` | — | `PATCH /api/me/profile` |
| `public-catalog-registration-flow.tsx` | `GET /api/me/profile` | — |
| `apps/portal/app/api/me/profile/route.ts` | upstream `GET /identity/me` | upstream `PATCH /identity/me` |

### Workspace SDK usage in portal (profile)

| Feature | SDK function | Used in portal? |
| ------- | ------------ | --------------- |
| Member profile capabilities | `resolveMemberProfileCapabilities` | **Yes** — BFF + form via capabilities echo |
| Member profile validators | `validateMemberProfile*` | **Yes** — BFF only (not UI) |

