## ARCHITECTURAL RULES (FREEZE GUARDRAILS)

Enforceable static rules (target: `guard:portal-member-profile-boundary`):

| ID | Rule | Detection |
| -- | ---- | --------- |
| **GR-MP-01** | Portal MUST NOT import `packages/workspaces/*` or `@app-tour/workspace-*` | import-boundary / grep |
| **GR-MP-02** | Portal MUST NOT contain business validation (regex for nationalId, birthDate, email) | grep in `apps/portal/app/me` |
| **GR-MP-03** | Only SDK may expose profile capabilities | no `editableFields` arrays in portal |
| **GR-MP-04** | Only identity may persist profile | portal never writes `membershipMetadata` |
| **GR-MP-05** | Only ONE profile BFF: `/api/me/profile` | legacy public-auth profile route removed (M4) |
| **GR-MP-06** | No `pluginId ===` / `workspace ===` in portal profile code | grep |
| **GR-MP-07** | No upstream identity URL in portal UI routes | boundary guard scans `app/me` + `src` |
| **GR-MP-08** | Profile UI fields must be driven by `resolveMemberProfileCapabilities` | contract test |

