## KEEP / CHANGE / REMOVE / AVOID

### KEEP

- Portal does not import workspace packages (today compliant)
- `identity/me` as persistence API authority
- `membershipMetadata` storage model
- `atour_mb_session` / `session-client` separation from operator
- Intake capability pattern (`resolveCatalogIntakeCapabilities`) as template
- `/api/me/registrations` + receipt BFF pattern
- `buildMemberApiHeaders` for authenticated member upstream calls
- P6 `/me` middleware + tenant host binding

### CHANGE (completed M1–M7)

- `/api/me/profile` is the sole profile BFF ✅
- SDK profile capability registry + portal BFF mapping ✅
- Capability-driven profile UI ✅
- Truth governance guards + drift report ✅

### REMOVE (completed)

- Legacy `session-profile` route ✅ M4
- Direct `identity/me` from portal UI/SSR ✅ M3
- Client-side regex validation in profile form ✅ M3
- snake_case profile DTO at portal boundary ✅ M2/M5

### AVOID

- `pluginId === "denali"` (or any workspace id) in portal profile code
- Static-importing workspace packages into portal
- Duplicating validation in UI, BFF, and workspace
- New profile fields without SDK capability + identity metadata doc
- Using exposure profiles as member profile storage
- Copying `apps/web` operator profile UI into portal without SDK contract
- SSR bypass of BFF for member profile reads

